# pop'n music 7: the four operator codes, typed in test mode > EVENT OPTIONS > PASSWORD
# (games/popn7/unlocks.toml), then the four new switches set to YES and SAVE AND EXIT.
# From a fresh save (the ROM set's RTC), it leaves the MAX save:
#   hiraku-popn7 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn7-phases.his
# Each code adds its switch to EVENT OPTIONS above PASSWORD and the menu comes back with the
# cursor on it. Hold red + press blue switches an option; blue 6/4 move down/up.
